{"node_id": "real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021_8_HY_001", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0004"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0004_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Migraine triggers, such as stress, are different from person to person", "semantic_text": "Migraine triggers, such as stress, are different from person to person", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0004_geometry", "bbox": [98, 816, 1100, 860], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0004"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_snapshot_non_nasa_20261118_2243_v2/batch_23/hybrid/real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021/page_0008/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021_8_HY_002", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0005"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0005_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Migraines are more than just a headache. They\ncan sometimes cause vomiting, exhaustion,\nirritability, and intense pain that can make it\nhard to do daily activities.", "semantic_text": "Migraines are more than just a headache. They can sometimes cause vomiting, exhaustion, irritability, and intense pain that can make it hard to do daily activities.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0005_geometry", "bbox": [76, 892, 592, 1016], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0005"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_snapshot_non_nasa_20261118_2243_v2/batch_23/hybrid/real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021/page_0008/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021_8_HY_003", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0006"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0006_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "“Before a migraine, you might get hit with a wave of\nfatigue or yawning,” says Linda Porter, Ph.D., of the\nNational Institute of Neurological Disorders and Stroke.\n“After the pain and severity goes away, people can have\nfatigue, brain fog, or high sensitivity to light.”", "semantic_text": "“Before a migraine, you might get hit with a wave of fatigue or yawning,” says Linda Porter, Ph.D., of the National Institute of Neurological Disorders and Stroke. “After the pain and severity goes away, people can have fatigue, brain fog, or high sensitivity to light.”", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0006_geometry", "bbox": [100, 1016, 576, 1141], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0006"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_snapshot_non_nasa_20261118_2243_v2/batch_23/hybrid/real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021/page_0008/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021_8_HY_004", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0007"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0007_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "In addition to a painful headache that often happens\non one side of the head, other symptoms include mood\nchanges, food cravings, nausea, and aura. Aura creates\nflashing, bright lights or “zigzags” in your field of vision.\nThese additional symptoms and aura usually happen prior\nto a headache and can often suggest to migraine sufferers\nthat the headache is on the way.", "semantic_text": "In addition to a painful headache that often happens on one side of the head, other symptoms include mood changes, food cravings, nausea, and aura. Aura creates flashing, bright lights or “zigzags” in your field of vision. These additional symptoms and aura usually happen prior to a headache and can often suggest to migraine sufferers that the headache is on the way.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0007_geometry", "bbox": [100, 1141, 596, 1316], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0007"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_snapshot_non_nasa_20261118_2243_v2/batch_23/hybrid/real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021/page_0008/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021_8_HY_005", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0009"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0009_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Women are three times more likely to suffer from\nmigraines than men. Hormonal changes, like menstrual\ncycles or pregnancy, can often lead to migraines. Most\nwomen see improvement after menopause. Children can\nalso get migraines.", "semantic_text": "Women are three times more likely to suffer from migraines than men. Hormonal changes, like menstrual cycles or pregnancy, can often lead to migraines. Most women see improvement after menopause. Children can also get migraines.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0009_geometry", "bbox": [100, 1366, 585, 1492], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0009"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_snapshot_non_nasa_20261118_2243_v2/batch_23/hybrid/real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021/page_0008/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021_8_HY_006", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0011"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0011_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "Migraine triggers differ widely from person to person.\nThese include stress, hormone changes, sleep cycle\nchanges, dehydration, loud sounds, strong smells, sudden\nchanges in environment, and tobacco or caffeine use.\nHowever, caffeine withdrawal can also cause migraines.", "semantic_text": "Migraine triggers differ widely from person to person. These include stress, hormone changes, sleep cycle changes, dehydration, loud sounds, strong smells, sudden changes in environment, and tobacco or caffeine use. However, caffeine withdrawal can also cause migraines.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0011_geometry", "bbox": [641, 948, 1134, 1072], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0011"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_snapshot_non_nasa_20261118_2243_v2/batch_23/hybrid/real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021/page_0008/decisions.json"}
